{"completed": true, "response": "想到也许能和对方更亲近，他心里仍然会觉得温暖、甜蜜。也正因为这种可能已经让他感到温暖，他就没法再把它当成一个无关紧要的念头，心里也开始有了一点不敢完全放松的感觉。他依然相信，靠近一个人本身就是有温度的，没有开始怀疑对方，也说不清自己到底在期待什么。这一点不安，只是因为那份模糊的期待已经变得有些重要，却还没有明确的方向。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1658f20c-0f2b-4409-b5df-285d23a11d3c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T003035925907Z", "elapsed_seconds": 6.625, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:30:42.539433+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2d7d4eb361b3b707de01a559e90c2b8196c8a278979d4802d36fde2101634f6d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T003035925907Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.p